  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fortalecimiento a la Secretar&#xed;a de Gobernaci&#xf3;n, Justicia y Descentralizaci&#xf3;n (SEGOB) en Honduras, con &#xe9;nfasis en la promoci&#xf3;n del acceso a la justicia con enfoque de g&#xe9;nero.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">The Projects objective is to build local capacities for the promotion and acceleration of community mechanisms for access to justice that resolve conflicts before they go to courts; to increase the capacities of municipalities (especially categories C and D) to create municipal investment plans that prioritize and favor investment in issues such as access to justice and gender; and to strengthen the municipal public policy framework to institutionalize investment models. The aim is to generate</narrative>
  </description>
